TEXT -96 728 Left 2 ;Five-transistor OTA: NMOS pair M1-M2, PMOS mirror load M3-M4, tail M5 mirrored from M6 (IB = 20 uA, 10 uA per side).\nGain = gm1 / (gds2 + gds4), GBW = gm1 / (2 pi CL); the inputs sit at 0.7 V, so the output can drive a unity-gain follower.
